#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/scheduler_info.rs:27
msgid "Designed for pure speed and minimal overhead. It makes decisions extremely fast and consumes almost zero CPU power for itself, leaving maximum raw performance for predictable workloads."
