#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/scheduler_info.rs:69
msgid "Designed to eliminate unnecessary CPU 'ticks' (timer wakes). This allows cores to sleep deeper and longer, making it an incredible choice for saving laptop battery life."
